{"audio": "revelation-08.opus", "duration_ms": 127202, "sentences": [{"start_ms": 2060, "end_ms": 3441, "text": "Revelation, Chapter Eight."}, {"start_ms": 4581, "end_ms": 9362, "text": "When the Lamb opened the seventh seal, there was silence in heaven for about half an hour."}, {"start_ms": 10002, "end_ms": 15063, "text": "And I saw the seven angels who stand before God, and they were given seven trumpets."}, {"start_ms": 15943, "end_ms": 20364, "text": "Then another angel, who had a golden censer, came and stood at the altar."}, {"start_ms": 21004, "end_ms": 27325, "text": "He was given much incense to offer, along with the prayers of all the saints, on the golden altar before the throne."}, {"start_ms": 28105, "end_ms": 33926, "text": "And the smoke of the incense, together with the prayers of the saints, rose up before God from the hand of the angel."}, {"start_ms": 34826, "end_ms": 44988, "text": "Then the angel took the censer, filled it with fire from the altar, and hurled it to the earth; and there were peals of thunder, rumblings, flashes of lightning, and an earthquake."}, {"start_ms": 45868, "end_ms": 49329, "text": "And the seven angels with the seven trumpets prepared to sound them."}, {"start_ms": 50209, "end_ms": 56490, "text": "Then the first angel sounded his trumpet, and hail and fire mixed with blood were hurled down upon the earth."}, {"start_ms": 57090, "end_ms": 61951, "text": "A third of the earth was burned up, along with a third of the trees and all the green grass."}, {"start_ms": 63011, "end_ms": 70152, "text": "Then the second angel sounded his trumpet, and something like a great mountain burning with fire was thrown into the sea."}, {"start_ms": 70932, "end_ms": 78194, "text": "A third of the sea turned to blood, a third of the living creatures in the sea died, and a third of the ships were destroyed."}, {"start_ms": 79134, "end_ms": 88575, "text": "Then the third angel sounded his trumpet, and a great star burning like a torch fell from heaven and landed on a third of the rivers and on the springs of water."}, {"start_ms": 89275, "end_ms": 91416, "text": "The name of the star is Wormwood."}, {"start_ms": 91976, "end_ms": 97417, "text": "A third of the waters turned bitter like wormwood oil, and many people died from the bitter waters."}, {"start_ms": 98297, "end_ms": 104238, "text": "Then the fourth angel sounded his trumpet, and a third of the sun and moon and stars were struck."}, {"start_ms": 104838, "end_ms": 110639, "text": "A third of the stars were darkened, a third of the day was without light, and a third of the night as well."}, {"start_ms": 111679, "end_ms": 117480, "text": "And as I observed, I heard an eagle flying overhead, calling in a loud voice, “Woe!"}, {"start_ms": 118100, "end_ms": 118500, "text": "Woe!"}, {"start_ms": 119101, "end_ms": 125882, "text": "Woe to those who dwell on the earth, because of the trumpet blasts about to be sounded by the remaining three angels!”"}], "words": [{"t": "Revelation,", "s": 2060, "e": 2600, "si": 0}, {"t": "Chapter", "s": 2800, "e": 3141, "si": 0}, {"t": "Eight.", "s": 3141, "e": 3441, "si": 0}, {"t": "When", "s": 4581, "e": 4721, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 4741, "e": 4801, "si": 1}, {"t": "Lamb", "s": 4861, "e": 5121, "si": 1}, {"t": "opened", "s": 5281, "e": 5621, "si": 1}, {"t": "the", "s": 5681, "e": 5761, "si": 1}, {"t": "seventh", "s": 5881, "e": 6241, "si": 1}, {"t": "seal,", "s": 6321, "e": 6601, "si": 1}, {"t": "there", "s": 6741, "e": 6901, "si": 1}, {"t": "was", "s": 6921, "e": 7061, "si": 1}, {"t": "silence", "s": 7161, "e": 7701, "si": 1}, {"t": "in", "s": 7781, "e": 7881, "si": 1}, {"t": "heaven", "s": 7961, "e": 8221, "si": 1}, {"t": "for", "s": 8301, "e": 8441, "si": 1}, {"t": "about", "s": 8481, "e": 8762, "si": 1}, {"t": "half", "s": 8822, "e": 9002, "si": 1}, {"t": "an", "s": 9062, "e": 9122, "si": 1}, {"t": "hour.", "s": 9142, "e": 9362, "si": 1}, {"t": "And", "s": 10002, "e": 10122, "si": 2}, {"t": "I", "s": 10242, "e":